sequenceDiagram
    title UC02 查询并预订航班——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户
    participant P1 as FlightSearch.vue
    participant P2 as FlightController
    participant P3 as TrafficOrderController
    participant P4 as TrafficOrderServiceImpl
    participant P5 as FlightMapper/OrderMapper
    P0->>P1: 输入城市、日期并选择乘客
    P1->>P2: GET /api/flight/search
    P2->>P5: 查询航班
    P5-->>P2: 返回航班列表
    P1->>P3: POST /api/order/flight/create
    P3->>P4: createFlightOrder(userId,dto)
    P4->>P5: 条件扣减座位并新增订单
    P5-->>P4: 返回 orderNo；库存不足则失败
    P4-->>P3: 返回待支付订单号
    Note over P0,P5: 库存扣减与订单写入处于同一事务；库存不足时不得创建订单。
